    "name": "Pivot Banking - ms-credit (Phase III)",
    "description": "Postman Collection for pivot-ms-credit (Phase III): loans and credit cards, blind-index lookup, block/unblock, consumption/payment, overdue handling, PAID_OFF transition and soft delete. Prerequisite: run ms-customer first and set personalCustomerId / businessCustomerId.",
